<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλείβω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour down</i>: hence, <i>cause to waste away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					131
				</span></i>
			(lyr.):—
				Pass.
			, <i>drop down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκίων μέλιτος καταλειβομένοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.109
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πέτρης καταλείβεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					786
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυά τ᾽ ἐκ δακρύων καταλείβεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					605
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <i>melt away</i> (in tears), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλειβομένης ἄλγεσι πολλοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1119
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλείβεσθαί νιν καὶ
				καταρρεῖν ὥσπερ τοὺς κολοσσούς</span>, in an
			imprecation, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Abh.Berl.Akad.</u>
				1925(5).21
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
